                ("edit-undo-symbolic", "Safe",
                 "A snapshot is taken before every update: if something breaks, pick an older one "
                 "in the boot menu (Snapshots)"),
                ("user-home-symbolic", "Your things stay",
                 "Your files, settings and Flathub apps are not touched")):
